body:
@jonashackt Just to clear out some confusion (or induce even more :sweat_smile:), `restart_policy` (as most of the v3 exclusive features) only takes effect when deploying stacks to a swarm (also see [Compose file version 3 reference](https://docs.docker.com/compose/compose-file/#deploy).

TBH I'm also not sure, if v3 is really intended to replace v2 for *classic* Docker-Compose use.

Still it also might worth discussing if it would make sense to support v3 as well a stack deployment to swarm.
